hundred-page deck and our capabilities and the&nbsp;
ideas we're going to bring forward. But the thing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:10.080 --> 00:16:16.600
you never can lose sight of is whomever makes&nbsp;
their idea easier to buy, we'll sell their idea.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:16.600 --> 00:16:21.840
Whoever makes their product easier to buy. So I&nbsp;
think anytime either I position the work or our&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:21.840 --> 00:16:29.200
company or myself, I try to give you a couple of&nbsp;
reasons for a yes rather than relying on someone&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:29.200 --> 00:16:34.360
else to put together my Cinderella story for me.
Tim Ferriss: Yeah, I mean you had different&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:34.360 --> 00:16:41.320
headings too. You had macro topics, and then later&nbsp;
