00:16:52.898 --> 00:16:55.880
Chris Beresford-Hill: That's right. There we go.
Tim Ferriss: And by the way, folks, number one,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:55.880 --> 00:16:59.280
this is not an invitation for thousands&nbsp;
of people to cold email, because trust me,&nbsp;&nbsp;

