00:17:04.760 --> 00:17:12.520
number two, is that, and then we're going to go to&nbsp;
father-son trips. That's going to be next step. So&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:12.520 --> 00:17:17.480
I'm going to precede that by preparing this. And&nbsp;
maybe you have discussed some of these bullets&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:17.480 --> 00:17:23.440
before in talks or in pieces you've written,&nbsp;
but you've also, the work that you did, even&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:23.440 --> 00:17:31.160
if I had not said yes, would be useful in other&nbsp;
places. Thinking about your career, your history,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:31.160 --> 00:17:36.640
the techniques that you've used is not lost if&nbsp;
