people, which helped me as a creative person.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:23.600 --> 00:22:30.000
But what would happen is I lived this double&nbsp;
life where at school I was this quiet, nice,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:36.000
invisible kid, and then I would chase my passions&nbsp;
and take these moonshots in my personal life.&nbsp;

00:22:36.000 --> 00:22:40.320
So I loved the New York Knicks. They&nbsp;
