Albert would reference that the Knicks had a big&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:58.000 --> 00:23:03.760
day of practice at SUNY Purchase before the&nbsp;
game, I banked that, and I happened to have a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:03.760 --> 00:23:09.080
friend that I would go see, and I noticed that&nbsp;
