I grabbed my friend and we ran for it and we&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:34.240 --> 00:23:40.800
slipped in, and practice was just ending. And&nbsp;
you could see people were filtering everywhere,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:40.800 --> 00:23:45.840
and a few Knicks were staying maybe to work on&nbsp;
some stuff. And I don't know what possessed me,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:45.840 --> 00:23:48.600
but I grabbed a ball and I started dribbling&nbsp;
it, and I kind of figured, "Okay, maybe they're&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:48.600 --> 00:23:53.720
going to think I'm like a trainer's kid or&nbsp;
" And so my friend, who I'm coaxing with me,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:53.720 --> 00:24:00.320
because my friend Steven did not want to do this.&nbsp;
So we start shooting, and then I swear on my life,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:00.320 --> 00:24:07.320
Tim, maybe it wasn't as pronounced or as dramatic&nbsp;
