Chris Beresford-Hill: Steven, God bless you.&nbsp;

00:26:04.743 --> 00:26:06.520
Tim Ferriss: — out of control.
Chris Beresford-Hill: I think we convinced,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:06.520 --> 00:26:11.120
I think it was my parents at the time, to drive&nbsp;
