00:26:55.456 --> 00:26:56.160
Tim Ferriss: With the patience of a saint.
Chris Beresford-Hill: With the patience of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:56.160 --> 00:27:04.360
a saint. And this is — when I said I was little,&nbsp;
