01:24:56.920 --> 01:25:01.707
Snickers bar. I felt like I was going to vomit,&nbsp;
but it was so good, and I knew it was so good.&nbsp;

01:25:01.707 --> 01:25:03.374
Tim Ferriss: Not vomiting&nbsp;
ideas, this is actually —&nbsp;

01:25:03.374 --> 01:25:07.640
Chris Beresford-Hill: No, actual vomit, bile. It&nbsp;
was a bile one. So anyway, I go back, and I sit. I&nbsp;&nbsp;

