01:25:12.880 --> 01:25:15.600
Actually, she always says the word "Babes." She&nbsp;
talks like a Hollywood producer. She goes, "That's&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:25:15.600 --> 01:25:21.520
cool, Babes." And I was like, "Thanks," and then&nbsp;
my phone rings. I see the number, and I say,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:25:21.520 --> 01:25:29.520
"I think I'm about to really get unloaded on." And&nbsp;
she goes, "Good luck." She was in on it. And I was&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:25:29.520 --> 01:25:35.760
like, "Okay. Okay, I've got my anchor here."
