happen. It happened, so I accept responsibility."&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:25:58.440 --> 01:26:03.800
I did not volunteer that I had endorsed it,&nbsp;
but I accepted the responsibility. I said,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:26:03.800 --> 01:26:09.320
"I will have our PR…" the toothpaste is out of&nbsp;
