01:27:13.040 --> 01:27:18.400
two, and you've got to say, "I think I can do&nbsp;
this." Sometimes you've got to pump the brakes,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:27:18.400 --> 01:27:23.320
and then sometimes you've got to gun it.&nbsp;
But really, it's a lonely decision. But&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:27:23.320 --> 01:27:26.400
you've got to make it, and you've got to have&nbsp;
confidence that you're going to thread the&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:27:26.400 --> 01:27:31.160
needle. And that's the getting away with it.
Tim Ferriss: So to use the racing metaphor,&nbsp;&nbsp;

