01:27:41.600 --> 01:27:45.720
routinely reckless. They do have to make&nbsp;
those decisions, but they're not routinely&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:27:45.720 --> 01:27:49.440
reckless, and you don't strike me as someone&nbsp;
who's routinely reckless. So what I want to&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:27:49.440 --> 01:27:56.880
ask you about this particular decision,&nbsp;
this calculus, in your mind, if you did,&nbsp;&nbsp;

