sports. That's going to be a bad look."
Chris Beresford-Hill: Yes.&nbsp;

01:28:13.747 --> 01:28:15.560
Tim Ferriss: It's not a hundred percent.
Chris Beresford-Hill: Nope.&nbsp;

01:28:15.560 --> 01:28:21.400
Tim Ferriss: But it would be a bad look. So how&nbsp;
did you think about the calculus and just like,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:28:21.400 --> 01:28:27.018
okay, worst, worst case, this is what&nbsp;
happens, but I'm not going to get killed.&nbsp;

01:28:27.018 --> 01:28:31.440
Chris Beresford-Hill: Here's what I thought. The&nbsp;
truth is, as you talk about what it feels like&nbsp;&nbsp;

