01:30:22.360 --> 01:30:25.707
that people could get music for free.
Chris Beresford-Hill: Yes.&nbsp;

01:30:25.707 --> 01:30:28.800
Tim Ferriss: Including new music.
Chris Beresford-Hill: And we were. And I think the&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:30:28.800 --> 01:30:34.560
