01:30:42.520 --> 01:30:48.720
was synonymous with that. So Napster, turns&nbsp;
out it maybe wasn't sharing and it goes away,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:30:48.720 --> 01:30:53.240
and then I think someone buys the naming rights or&nbsp;
something and it relaunches a few years later. So&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:30:53.240 --> 01:31:01.200
it relaunches in maybe 2002 as a way too ahead of&nbsp;
its time streaming platform where the proposition&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:31:01.200 --> 01:31:07.480
was 10 bucks a month and unlimited plays, a&nbsp;
million songs. And it was a streaming database&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:31:07.480 --> 01:31:13.400
that you could subscribe to. Again, way ahead of&nbsp;
its time. So we had been given the assignment to&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:31:13.400 --> 01:31:18.480
