01:31:57.840 --> 01:32:03.360
this is, I'm talking 2002, 2003, this would've&nbsp;
been pretty ahead of its time. And we built a&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:32:03.360 --> 01:32:08.680
website with this cool design, Crashter.com. We&nbsp;
made a bounty list and it was all the way from&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:32:08.680 --> 01:32:14.360
$250 for a local radio show. If you said&nbsp;
1.5 million songs, unlimited downloads,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:32:14.360 --> 01:32:19.360
napster.com all the way to, if you crashed a&nbsp;
presidential address, you got a million dollars.&nbsp;

01:32:19.360 --> 01:32:23.800
And I think we had two and a half million&nbsp;
dollars if you said that line during a live&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:32:23.800 --> 01:32:29.360
