of crazy stuff. Lawyers were okay with it. I&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:32:35.120 --> 01:32:39.320
know we just said something about lawyers,&nbsp;
but this thing was done. We had insurance,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:32:39.320 --> 01:32:43.880
we built the site. Anyway, we even did an&nbsp;
