and that and the other. And then he says, "Oh,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:33:38.920 --> 01:33:44.320
one more thing. We're going to do this next week."&nbsp;
And he brings it up, and I'm not in the room,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:33:44.320 --> 01:33:50.680
but this is the report we got back that he shares,&nbsp;
Crashter.com walks through it and the chairman of&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:33:50.680 --> 01:33:54.800
the board just interrupts him and just says,&nbsp;
"I'm going to interrupt you before you finish.&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:33:54.800 --> 01:33:59.160
Just to let you know, we are not doing that."
And that was it. And this thing could not&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:33:59.160 --> 01:34:06.600
have been more firmly dead, but that was for&nbsp;
21, I learned that if you get what you need,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:34:06.600 --> 01:34:11.040
