served me well, has served many people well,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:34:11.640 --> 01:34:15.627
to not get into lily gilding and see what&nbsp;
happens when everyone starts thinking about —&nbsp;

01:34:15.627 --> 01:34:17.840
Tim Ferriss: Don't linger.
