your job is and ask you a question about it. But I&nbsp;
just feel that constantly with just please go read&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:37:58.240 --> 01:38:03.760
this book and if you can't live without doing&nbsp;
what's in this book, then we'll get time. But&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:38:03.760 --> 01:38:09.880
that book is perfect. But then for the creative&nbsp;
journey or even to understand what it's like,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:38:09.880 --> 01:38:15.080
there's three video bits of content. We were&nbsp;
chatting about them earlier. Number one,&nbsp;&nbsp;

