01:53:55.840 --> 01:53:59.040
understand having been on the receiving end of&nbsp;
those kind of culture, those kind of behaviors,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:53:59.040 --> 01:54:02.800
it's just, it's great stuff. But that's&nbsp;
one of the few things that I reread&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:54:02.800 --> 01:54:06.800
