with him in the — he's in classroom and he —
Tim Ferriss: He's with the teacher.&nbsp;

01:54:52.858 --> 01:54:55.000
Chris Beresford-Hill: And he's&nbsp;
— oh, yeah. And he's amazing.&nbsp;

01:54:55.000 --> 01:55:03.560
Tim Ferriss: So fast, so fast on his feet.&nbsp;
Unbelievable. And another just quick side note,&nbsp;&nbsp;

