01:55:45.640 --> 01:55:53.920
You mentioned before we started recording that&nbsp;
you had an answer for the under a hundred dollars&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:55:53.920 --> 01:56:00.560
best investment. I mean, best investment is one&nbsp;
