01:56:00.560 --> 01:56:05.600
anything that you've spent kind of less than a&nbsp;
hundred dollars on, that has had a material impact&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:56:05.600 --> 01:56:08.120
on you. What is your answer for that?
Chris Beresford-Hill: My first&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:56:08.120 --> 01:56:10.058
Tone House class, $34.
Tim Ferriss: Ah, there we go.&nbsp;

01:56:10.058 --> 01:56:11.440
Chris Beresford-Hill: That was the one. That was&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:56:11.440 --> 01:56:15.360
the $34 purchase that changed everything.
Tim Ferriss: Is there anything else that&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:56:15.360 --> 01:56:20.000
comes to mind? Maybe it's a second place, but just&nbsp;
