01:56:47.480 --> 01:56:54.200
one of my mentors, I go with a peer who I get a&nbsp;
lot of energy from or an old friend that I haven't&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:56:54.200 --> 01:57:00.480
caught up with. And the bill, no matter how you do&nbsp;
